# Bitmap blob envelope contract
#
# This file documents the format assumptions for the V1 bitmap BLOB wrapper.
# It is intentionally scaffold-only and should be enabled once the blob helpers
# are wired into a real DuckDB extension entry point.
#
# Envelope layout:
#   bytes 0..3   magic = "FPBM"
#   byte  4      format version = 1
#   byte  5      payload encoding = 1 (CRoaring portable serialization)
#   bytes 6..7   reserved = 0
#   bytes 8..11  payload length
#   bytes 12..N  CRoaring portable payload
#
# Cases to enable later:
# - valid empty payload round-trips
# - invalid magic is rejected
# - invalid version is rejected
# - payload length mismatch is rejected
# - payload bytes are preserved exactly

